# ❄️ FlowSight — Project Documentation

> Openflow (NiFi) Job Status Dashboard, built on Snowflake Streamlit.
> This document is the canonical project reference. For a quick feature
> overview see `README.md`; this file covers architecture, internals,
> operations, and maintenance in depth.

